WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.880 --> 00:00:03.336
- My name is Ioannis Ikonomou.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.848
I'm from Greece, and I speak 32 languages.

00:00:05.848 --> 00:00:08.355
Russian, Portuguese, Norwegian, Turkish,

00:00:08.355 --> 00:00:10.461
Hungarian, Czech, Polish--

00:00:10.461 --> 00:00:13.723
- [Narrator] Ioannis is what
we call a hyperpolyglot.

00:00:13.723 --> 00:00:17.140
It means he can speak a lot of languages.

00:00:29.039 --> 00:00:30.960
See, the thing is, Ioannis,

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:32.710
he's a quick learner.

00:00:42.586 --> 00:00:44.608
This doesn't happen by
just sitting at home

00:00:44.608 --> 00:00:46.358
and studying, though.

00:01:10.261 --> 00:01:12.389
The world is a big place
with different cultures

00:01:12.389 --> 00:01:14.889
and, yes, different languages.

00:01:29.125 --> 00:01:32.946
Wait, wait, before we go:
if anyone knows, it's you.

00:01:32.946 --> 00:01:35.994
What is the most complicated
language to learn?

00:01:35.994 --> 00:01:36.911
- Mandarin.

00:01:37.775 --> 00:01:40.108
- [Narrator[ Mystery Solved.

